#!/bin/sh
exec foot --title "Hyprland keybinds" sh -c 'LESS="-R --use-color -M" less <<'"'"'EOF'"'"'
Hyprland uConsole - Keybindings

Super = the key remapped from KEY_OPEN

Applications
  Super + Enter        Terminal
  Super + T            Terminal
  Super + D            Application launcher
  Super + E            File manager
  Super + C            Editor
  Super + B            Browser
  Super + H            This help screen
  Super + Shift + B    Restart top bar
  Super + Shift + C    CAVA audio bars
  Super + Shift + T    Theme picker

Windows
  Ctrl + Q             Close active window
  Alt + F4             Close active window
  Super + Shift + Q    Close active window
  Super + Tab          Cycle to next window and raise it
  Alt + Tab            Cycle focus
  Super + F            Fullscreen
  Shift + F11          Fullscreen
  Super + Space        Floating / tiled
  Super + G            Toggle window group
  Super + J            Toggle split orientation
  Super + Shift + P    Pseudo-tile

Focus and window movement
  Super + Arrows              Move focus
  Super + Shift + Arrows      Move window
  Super + Alt + Arrows        Resize window
  Super + left mouse          Move window
  Super + right mouse         Resize window
  Super + Z                   Drag-move window
  Super + X                   Drag-resize window

Workspaces
  Super + 1..9 / 0             Go to workspace 1..10
  Super + Shift + 1..9 / 0     Move window to workspace 1..10
  Super + Ctrl + Right         Next workspace
  Super + Ctrl + Left          Previous workspace
  Super + Ctrl + Down          Empty workspace
  Ctrl + Left/Right            Previous/next existing workspace

Wallpapers
  Super + Shift + W    Pick wallpaper
  Super + Shift + .    Next wallpaper
  Super + Shift + ,    Previous wallpaper
  Wallpaper key        Pick wallpaper
  Shift + wallpaper key Next wallpaper
  Ctrl + wallpaper key  Previous wallpaper

Store wallpapers in:
  ~/.local/share/wallpapers
  ~/Pictures/Wallpapers

Scratchpad
  Super + S            Show/hide scratchpad
  Super + Shift + S    Move window to scratchpad

The scratchpad is a hidden workspace. Move a window there with
Super+Shift+S and show or hide it with Super+S.

Hardware
  Volume keys          Volume down/up/mute
  Brightness keys      Brightness down/up
  Print                Region screenshot to clipboard
  XF86 media           Play/next/previous

System
  Super + Shift + R    Reload Hyprland
  Super + Shift + E    Exit Hyprland
  Super + Delete       Exit Hyprland

Notes
  Super + T is kept as a terminal alias for the uConsole layout.

Help navigation
  Arrows / wheel       Scroll
  PageUp / PageDown    Page scroll
  Home / End           Start / end
  /text                Search
  q                    Close
EOF
'
